This makes it possible to find out if they allow their messages to be tracked, whether they subscribe to new posts, favor certain messages, etc.
This new Twitter menu offer had been tested "at a small percentage of users" ahead of its general internet distribution on Monday, Twitter spokeswoman Carolyn Penner told French press agency AFP.
